{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Island Life With Mayalala",
    "steam_appid": 3421080,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/d925ae1df35af52c935bb708f0d8b2ad.avif?t=1754712009\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akitoshi decided to take a vacation on Earth to rest and recover from the drudge of office life. Everything was perfect... Until a sudden storm sank the ship he was on! Now he's been washed ashore on a random island in the middle of who knows where, attacked by a wild animal, and saved by a mysterious woman. What will happen to him now?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/b1b497df4a9abd9fe8609d72a860a453.avif?t=1754712009\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know your savior, investigate the island... Do whatever you have to in order to survive and escape this tropical nightmare in this island exploration adventure RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/6585f3db7ee769505dc41c477b847b7e.avif?t=1754712009\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/74c21dcece2595b635d664c16b1b5b0a.avif?t=1754712009\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/99ab1671f917724b317d6c3d9f09bde2.avif?t=1754712009\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/417d663cb40a61a98722bb8418da7070.avif?t=1754712009\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate the Island</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a secret hidden here, and you'll need to leave no stone unturned in order to uncover it... perhaps learning more about the enigmatic Mayalala in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Art</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a wide array of expertly drawn character art as you take in the gorgeous island scenery. With sights like these, maybe this can still be a vacation to remember!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Endings to Uncover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no shortage of dangers on the island... Can you brave them and live long enough to find your way back to your home planet?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/d925ae1df35af52c935bb708f0d8b2ad.avif?t=1754712009\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akitoshi decided to take a vacation on Earth to rest and recover from the drudge of office life. Everything was perfect... Until a sudden storm sank the ship he was on! Now he's been washed ashore on a random island in the middle of who knows where, attacked by a wild animal, and saved by a mysterious woman. What will happen to him now?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/b1b497df4a9abd9fe8609d72a860a453.avif?t=1754712009\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know your savior, investigate the island... Do whatever you have to in order to survive and escape this tropical nightmare in this island exploration adventure RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/6585f3db7ee769505dc41c477b847b7e.avif?t=1754712009\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/74c21dcece2595b635d664c16b1b5b0a.avif?t=1754712009\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/99ab1671f917724b317d6c3d9f09bde2.avif?t=1754712009\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/417d663cb40a61a98722bb8418da7070.avif?t=1754712009\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate the Island</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a secret hidden here, and you'll need to leave no stone unturned in order to uncover it... perhaps learning more about the enigmatic Mayalala in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Art</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a wide array of expertly drawn character art as you take in the gorgeous island scenery. With sights like these, maybe this can still be a vacation to remember!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Endings to Uncover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no shortage of dangers on the island... Can you brave them and live long enough to find your way back to your home planet?</p>",
    "short_description": "An isolated island full of dangerous animals, a mysterious woman... Just what has Akitoshi gotten himself into?",
